Leaflet 1.9.4 - https://leafletjs.com

Vendored here, byte for byte, from the package published at
https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/ (leaflet.js, leaflet.css, images/).
The SHA-256 of leaflet.js is 20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=
and of leaflet.css p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY= (base64, the
same values the pages used as subresource integrity when they loaded it from
the CDN); tests/test_web.py checks them. Shipped with the app for the same
reason the fonts are: every field phone would otherwise report to a third
party to draw the map, and a CDN outage on race morning would be no map at
all.

